# CodeGraph local index (machine-specific)
.codegraph/

# graphify knowledge-graph output — committed deliberately. graph.json,
# graph.html, GRAPH_REPORT.md and the community labels document the project's
# own structure, so they belong in the repo (see
# reports/v2026.09.18/AUDIT_AND_RECOMMENDATIONS.md). Extraction scratch and
# machine-specific interpreter/path state stay ignored.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
